<title>POLAND: Exbud Q2 net rises to PLN 5.4 mln.</title>
<headline>Exbud Q2 net rises to PLN 5.4 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Exbud SA preliminary results for the second quarter of the year ending June 30, 1997.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>						Q2 1997	Q2 1996</p>
<p>    operating profit		     3.77   vs   1.76</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit			 7.55   vs   2.83</p>
<p>    net profit			     5.41   vs   2.28</p>
<p>NOTE - full company name is: Exbud SA.</p>
<p>    net sales			     93.74   vs  61.95</p>
<p>    costs of sales			91.42   vs  55.47</p>
<p>    extraordinary profit		 0.04   vs   0.01 loss</p>
<p>    income tax			     2.14   vs   0.56</p>
<p>    other taxes			     na	    na</p>
<p>    financial revenues		  11.44   vs   5.77</p>
<p>    financial costs		     91.42   vs  55.47</p>
<p>    investment			    38.00   vs   8.02</p>
<p>						H1 1997	H1 1996</p>
<p>    operating profit		     5.59   vs   2.93</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit			12.13   vs   4.82</p>
<p>    net profit			     8.54   vs   4.01</p>
<p>    net sales			    151.41   vs 114.41</p>
<p>    costs of sales		     141.01   vs 102.57</p>
<p>    extraordinary profit		 0.03   vs   0.01 loss</p>
<p>    income tax			     3.58   vs   0.81</p>
<p>    other taxes			     na	    na</p>
<p>    financial revenues		  20.98   vs  10.63</p>
<p>    financial costs		     14.48   vs   8.73</p>
<p>    investment			    48.00   vs  10.19</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
